	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>You command creatures to follow your lead as you lead them in a dance.</em></p><p><strong>[[/save wis]]{Wisdom Save}</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure: </strong>The target is &amp;reference[Charmed] by you and (if charmed) moves up to 15 ft. in a direction of your choice. While charmed, the target is &amp;reference[dazed] and &amp;reference[restrained]. Target rolls again at end of their turns, ending effect on success.</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> No effect.</p></li><li><p><strong>Concentration:</strong> Once on each subsequent turn, you can make all charmed targets move up to 15 ft. again.</p><ul><li><p>You lose concentration on this spell if you become &amp;reference[prone] or your speed becomes 0.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>Upcasting:</strong> Target two additional creatures for every spell level above 6th.</p>",
			"chat": ""
		},
